 r←Test_CopyReg_006(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;rc;list
⍝ Exercise the "list=" option with latest ←→ 1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 parms←##.Client.CreateCopyRegistryParms ⍬
 parms.url←##.Client.ReplaceRegistryAlias'[localhost]'
 parms.dry←1
 parms.list←'aplteam-aplprocess'
 parms.latest←1
 parms.dependencies←0
 list←##.Client.CopyRegistry parms
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢list

 parms.list←'aplteam-aplprocess-1'   ⍝ Should be the latest!
 list←##.Client.CopyRegistry parms
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢list
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'aplteam-APLProcess-1.0.0')∊list

 parms.list←'aplteam-aplprocess,aplteam-APLTreeUtils2'   ⍝ Asks for the latest of every major version no.
 list←##.Client.CopyRegistry parms
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢list
 →T.PassesIf∧/('aplteam-APLProcess-1.0.0' 'aplteam-APLProcess-0.5.1')∊list

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
